 "subject": "Google cuts the time software makers get to fix bugs",
 "preview": "Tencent's new voice model searches the web mid-call, a Huawei-backed project lets agents write their own plugins, and a voice test shows which assistants still talk over people.",
 "body": "<!-- buttondown-editor-mode: fancy -->\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all\">Tencent&#x27;s new voice model searches the web mid-call, a Huawei-backed project lets agents write their own plugins, and a voice test shows which assistants still talk over people.&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#6b6b6b;\">News from Saturday, November 14, 2026 · <a style=\"color:#6b6b6b;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://ai.mediancanadian.ca/issues/daily/2026/11/2026-11-14.html\">Read on the web</a></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#3d3d3d;\">Tencent's new voice model searches the web mid-call, a Huawei-backed project lets agents write their own plugins, and a voice test shows which assistants still talk over people.</p>\n<h2 style=\"margin:34px 0 14px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #e6e6e6;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6b6b\">What matters today</h2>\n<div style=\"margin:0 0 30px\"><img src=\"https://ai.mediancanadian.ca/assets/art/2026-11-14-0.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:600px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:12px\"><h3 style=\"margin:14px 0 6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:500;color:#111111\">Bug-fix time cut</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#111111;\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://projectzero.google/2026/11/disclosure-policy.html\">Google's Project Zero cuts the time software makers get to fix bugs it reports</a>.</p><ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:20px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3d3d3d\"><li style=\"margin:0 0 6px\"><strong>Full 90:</strong> from November 13, every bug it reports to a company goes public 90 days later, fixed or not. The <strong>extra 30 days for users to update are gone</strong>.</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 6px\"><strong>Shrinking:</strong> 60 days from February 2, 2027, then 30 days from January 3, 2028.</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 6px\"><strong>Why:</strong> AI lets attackers find bugs, or work them out from a patch, almost at once. Project Zero now finds several a week where it once found a few a year.</li></ul><p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#111111;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6b6b\">Why it matters</span><br>AI speeds up attackers and defenders alike. Anyone shipping software has less time between a bug report and a public exploit, so shipping fixes fast becomes part of the product.</p></div>\n<div style=\"margin:0 0 30px\"><img src=\"https://ai.mediancanadian.ca/assets/art/2026-11-14-1.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:600px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:12px\"><h3 style=\"margin:14px 0 6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:500;color:#111111\">Voice that searches mid-call</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#111111;\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://www.ithome.com/1/026/825.htm\">Tencent releases Hy Realtime, a voice model that can use tools</a>.</p><ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:20px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3d3d3d\"><li style=\"margin:0 0 6px\"><strong>Live</strong> since November 13 in Yuanbao voice calls and Tencent's customer service. An <strong>API on Tencent Cloud</strong> is coming, with no date given.</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 6px\"><strong>What it does:</strong> works out what people mean when they trail off or correct themselves, decides on its own when to search the web, and sings songs on request.</li></ul><p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#111111;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6b6b\">Why it matters</span><br>Voice assistants are moving from answering to doing things during the call. Tencent proves it on its own users and support lines first, then sells the same model to everyone else.</p></div>\n<div style=\"margin:0 0 30px\"><img src=\"https://ai.mediancanadian.ca/assets/art/2026-11-14-2.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:600px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:12px\"><h3 style=\"margin:14px 0 6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:500;color:#111111\">Agents add their own features</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#111111;\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://www.qbitai.com/2026/11/509653.html\">openJiuwen lets agents build and install their own plugins</a>.</p><ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:20px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3d3d3d\"><li style=\"margin:0 0 6px\"><strong>How:</strong> a user describes a feature, and the WorkSwarm agent writes, packages and installs it without touching the app's code. A plugin that breaks can be <strong>rolled back</strong>.</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 6px\"><strong>Open source:</strong> released November 13 by the Huawei-backed community, with WorkSwarm's code on GitHub under Apache-2.0. A plugin can run sessions on Claude Code or Codex.</li></ul><p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#111111;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6b6b\">Why it matters</span><br>Features no longer all come from the product team: each user's agent can add its own. That makes safe install and rollback more important than the roadmap.</p></div>\n<h2 style=\"margin:34px 0 14px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #e6e6e6;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6b6b\">Research worth watching</h2>\n<div style=\"margin:0 0 18px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 4px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#111111;\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;font-weight:500\" href=\"https://openmoss.ai/blog/en/moss-live/\">Voice AI that knows when to stay quiet</a></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3d3d3d;\">OpenMOSS tested its MOSS-Live voice system against OpenAI's and ByteDance's. It answered speech not meant for it <strong>2% of the time, against 68% for GPT-Live-1</strong>, but trailed GPT-Live-1 on multi-step tasks.</p><p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#111111;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6b6b\">Why it matters</span><br>Talking over people is now measurable. Test it before a voice agent joins real calls.</p></div>\n<div style=\"margin:0 0 18px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 4px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#111111;\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;font-weight:500\" href=\"https://www.langchain.com/blog/goal-engineering\">Scope agents so people can coach them</a></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3d3d3d;\">LangChain and Actively AI say agents fail mostly for lack of know-how that lives in people's heads. Actively <strong>moved from one agent per sales account to one per type of job</strong>, so reps review similar work together.</p><p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#111111;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6b6b\">Why it matters</span><br>Give agents goals that are easy for people to review, since feedback is how they get better.</p></div>\n<h2 style=\"margin:34px 0 14px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #e6e6e6;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6b6b\">What developers are debating</h2>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3d3d3d;\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50499017\">Lovable apps leak data</a>: a study of Lovable-built apps found private data readable without a login; developers argued that easy app builders make easy targets, and the author answered questions. 842 points, 319 comments.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3d3d3d;\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50491980\">Qwen3.8-27B on small GPUs</a>: Unsloth's updated compressed versions drew developers comparing quality and speed on home graphics cards and Macs. 251 points, 83 comments.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3d3d3d;\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50497589\">DeepSeek V3 in 200 lines</a>: a rebuild of the model's three main ideas in about 190 lines of JAX; developers praised it as a way to learn how models work. 236 points, 22 comments.</p>\n<h2 style=\"margin:34px 0 14px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #e6e6e6;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6b6b\">Top launches yesterday</h2>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 18px;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"40\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"width:40px;padding:0;vertical-align:middle\"><img src=\"https://ph-files.imgix.net/d7ed14d3-866f-467d-9320-b0a96855b181.svg?auto=format\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;width:28px;height:28px;margin:0;border:0;border-radius:6px\"></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding:0;vertical-align:middle\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:22px;font-weight:500\" href=\"https://hiringnow.ai/\">HiringNow</a></td></tr><tr><td width=\"40\" style=\"width:40px;padding:0\"></td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:4px 0 0;vertical-align:top\"><div style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#3d3d3d\">A job agent that watches company career pages for new postings, tailors your resume and applies once you approve each one.</div></td></tr></table>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 18px;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"40\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"width:40px;padding:0;vertical-align:middle\"><img src=\"https://ph-files.imgix.net/55ff92fa-d689-4108-9767-0590e91892b0.png?auto=format\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;width:28px;height:28px;margin:0;border:0;border-radius:6px\"></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding:0;vertical-align:middle\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:22px;font-weight:500\" href=\"https://trydex.ai/\">Dex Semantics</a></td></tr><tr><td width=\"40\" style=\"width:40px;padding:0\"></td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:4px 0 0;vertical-align:top\"><div style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#3d3d3d\">Notes on what each table means and how numbers add up, so a coding agent building analytics makes fewer mistakes.</div></td></tr></table>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 18px;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"40\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"width:40px;padding:0;vertical-align:middle\"><img src=\"https://ph-files.imgix.net/ae509a62-bee3-4ed5-85cd-ee309c8f1e3b.png?auto=format\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;width:28px;height:28px;margin:0;border:0;border-radius:6px\"></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding:0;vertical-align:middle\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:22px;font-weight:500\" href=\"https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-robotics-2-5-accelerates-real-world-physical-intelligence/\">Gemini Robotics 2.5</a></td></tr><tr><td width=\"40\" style=\"width:40px;padding:0\"></td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:4px 0 0;vertical-align:top\"><div style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#3d3d3d\">Google DeepMind's model that turns what a robot sees and is told into arm and hand movements.</div></td></tr></table>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 18px;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"40\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"width:40px;padding:0;vertical-align:middle\"><img src=\"https://ph-files.imgix.net/1f54a614-315b-42b4-9a27-1c6bef1d2016.png?auto=format\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;width:28px;height:28px;margin:0;border:0;border-radius:6px\"></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding:0;vertical-align:middle\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:22px;font-weight:500\" href=\"https://www.blender.org/\">Blender 5.3</a></td></tr><tr><td width=\"40\" style=\"width:40px;padding:0\"></td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:4px 0 0;vertical-align:top\"><div style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#3d3d3d\">The free 3D suite now opens and renders Gaussian splats, 3D scenes captured from photos, without add-ons.</div></td></tr></table>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 18px;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"40\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"width:40px;padding:0;vertical-align:middle\"><img src=\"https://ph-files.imgix.net/9569af37-10ce-4bc6-a414-94269060cfce.png?auto=format\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;width:28px;height:28px;margin:0;border:0;border-radius:6px\"></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding:0;vertical-align:middle\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:22px;font-weight:500\" href=\"https://www.uber.com/us/en/parking/\">Uber Parking</a></td></tr><tr><td width=\"40\" style=\"width:40px;padding:0\"></td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:4px 0 0;vertical-align:top\"><div style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#3d3d3d\">Find, compare and book parking inside the Uber app, with prices up front.</div></td></tr></table>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 18px;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"40\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"width:40px;padding:0;vertical-align:middle\"><img src=\"https://ph-files.imgix.net/0327dacb-2b04-46e6-af7b-9949c415b8b9.svg?auto=format\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;width:28px;height:28px;margin:0;border:0;border-radius:6px\"></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding:0;vertical-align:middle\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:22px;font-weight:500\" href=\"https://kokonutui.com/\">Kokonut UI</a></td></tr><tr><td width=\"40\" style=\"width:40px;padding:0\"></td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:4px 0 0;vertical-align:top\"><div style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#3d3d3d\">Over 100 free interface components a coding agent can find, install and edit in your code through MCP.</div></td></tr></table>\n<h2 style=\"margin:34px 0 14px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #e6e6e6;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6b6b\">Also in the news</h2>\n<ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:20px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#3d3d3d\"><li style=\"margin:0 0 8px\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://www.digitaltrends.com/computing/microsoft-365-outage-resolved/\"><strong>Microsoft 365</strong></a>: service fully restored after an outage of more than a day that hit Outlook, Teams and Copilot; Microsoft traced it to an earlier network capacity upgrade.</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 8px\"><a style=\"color:#111111;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://teslanorth.com/2026/11/14/grok-bot-efficiency-more-usage/\"><strong>Grok Bot</strong></a>: changes to the agent's software give about 7% more usage per plan and up to 15% on routine runs, after complaints that plans ran out fast.</li></ul>\n<hr style=\"border:0;border-top:1px solid #e6e6e6;margin:32px 0 16px\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#6b6b6b;\">You get the AI Brief because you subscribed at <a style=\"color:#6b6b6b;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://ai.mediancanadian.ca/\">ai.mediancanadian.ca</a>. <a style=\"color:#6b6b6b;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"{{ unsubscribe_url }}\">Unsubscribe</a> at any time; it takes effect at once.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#6b6b6b;\">The AI Brief is from The Median Canadian. Contact: <a style=\"color:#6b6b6b;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"mailto:info@mediancanadian.ca\">info@mediancanadian.ca</a>. <a style=\"color:#6b6b6b;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://ai.mediancanadian.ca/privacy.html\">Privacy</a>.</p>\n",
